E8EE DD44             (    forth6809.asm):03715                  STD   PFIELD
E8F0 3706             (    forth6809.asm):03716                  PULU  D
E8F2 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03717                  PSHU  D
E8F4 DC44             (    forth6809.asm):03718                  LDD   PFIELD
E8F6 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03719                  PSHU  D
