                      (    forth6809.asm):05392                                   ; clobbers A, D's high byte, corrupting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):05393                                   ; count before SUBD used it. Unlike FILL,
                      (    forth6809.asm):05394                                   ; there's no spare 16-bit register to keep
