F558 DD08             (    forth6809.asm):05507                  STD   CODEHERE   ; where WORD is about to write its parsed
                      (    forth6809.asm):05508                                   ; text. Without this, the compiled path
                      (    forth6809.asm):05509                                   ; below would compile "JSR DOSTR" (3 bytes)
                      (    forth6809.asm):05510                                   ; directly at CODEHERE - the same address
                      (    forth6809.asm):05511                                   ; WORD just used - overwriting the first 2
                      (    forth6809.asm):05512                                   ; characters of the very text being staged,
                      (    forth6809.asm):05513                                   ; before the copy loop even runs. Reserving
                      (    forth6809.asm):05514                                   ; the gap first means the text lands exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):05515                                   ; where it needs to end up, and the trampoline
                      (    forth6809.asm):05516                                   ; safely goes in front of it instead of on
                      (    forth6809.asm):05517                                   ; top of it.
