F8E1                  (    forth6809.asm):06051         SUBSTITUTEW: ; REWRITE: was a plain substring search-and-replace on
                      (    forth6809.asm):06052                      ; the bare registered name (via SEARCHW), which found
                      (    forth6809.asm):06053                      ; "girl" and replaced only that span, leaving surrounding
                      (    forth6809.asm):06054                      ; "%...%" delimiters untouched in the output - and never
                      (    forth6809.asm):06055                      ; returned the substitution count ANS requires as a
                      (    forth6809.asm):06056                      ; third stack item. Per the ANS spec (forth-standard.org/
                      (    forth6809.asm):06057                      ; standard/string/SUBSTITUTE), SUBSTITUTE must scan for
                      (    forth6809.asm):06058                      ; text between '%' (ASCII $25) delimiter pairs
                      (    forth6809.asm):06059                      ; specifically: "%%" collapses to a single '%' (count
