                      (    forth6809.asm):06817                                      ; size of the scratch area whose address
                      (    forth6809.asm):06818                                      ; is returned by PAD") - PAD's own region,
                      (    forth6809.asm):06819                                      ; growing upward from PAD itself, distinct
                      (    forth6809.asm):06820                                      ; from HOLDMINSIZE above (which answers
                      (    forth6809.asm):06821                                      ; for a different region entirely, the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06822                                      ; downward-growing pictured-numeric buffer
                      (    forth6809.asm):06823                                      ; in the CODEHERE-to-PAD gap). PADOFFSET
